#. {ph4}: </span >
#. {ph5}: <span class="flow-note" >
#. {ph6}: <code>renderer.js</code>
#. {ph7}: <code>preload.js</code>
#. {ph8}: </span >
#: website/public/guides/javascript/index.html:236
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/javascript/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Renderer → preload{ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}{ph6} calls the API exposed "
"by {ph7}.{ph8}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Средство визуализации → предварительная "
"загрузка{ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}{ph6} вызывает API, предоставляемый с "
"помощью {ph7}.{ph8}"

#. {ph0}: <span class="flow-label">
#. {ph1}: </span >
#. {ph2}: <span class="flow-node">
#. {ph3}: <code>notes:export</code>
#. {ph4}: </span >
#. {ph5}: <span class="flow-note" >
#. {ph6}: </span >
#: website/public/guides/javascript/index.html:244
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:guides/javascript/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Between processes{ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}The preload invokes an IPC "
"channel: a named message to the main process.{ph6}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Примечания: При экспорте предварительной загрузки вызывается IPC-канал:"
" именованное сообщение для основного процесса{ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}.{ph6}"

#. {ph0}: <span class="flow-label">
#. {ph1}: </span >
#. {ph2}: <span class="flow-node">
#. {ph3}: </span >
#. {ph4}: <span class="flow-note" >
